<title>JAPAN: Japan police arrest ANA plane hijacker - ministry.</title>
<headline>Japan police arrest ANA plane hijacker - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hijacker of an All Nippon Airways (ANA) Boeing 777 was arrested on Monday shortly after the aircraft landed at Fukuoka airport in southern Japan, a Transport Ministry spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman told Reuters that the hijacker took over the plane during a two-hour flight from the Osaka area in western Japan to Fukuoka.</p>
</text>
